WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.780 --> 00:00:19.512
"Art Week is finally here!"

2
00:00:19.873 --> 00:00:20.793
Gaby exclaimed.

3
00:00:20.813 --> 00:00:22.294
"I'm so excited!"

4
00:00:23.315 --> 00:00:27.098
It was Monday morning, and Ben was walking to school with Gaby.

5
00:00:27.118 --> 00:00:29.880
"I'm not into art," he said.

6
00:00:30.296 --> 00:00:31.237
"But I am excited.

7
00:00:31.737 --> 00:00:35.180
I've got my first assignment for the Monster Academy Times.

8
00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:37.722
I'm supposed to write an article about Art Week.

9
00:00:38.463 --> 00:00:41.265
If the article is good, I might get some more assignments."

10
00:00:41.285 --> 00:00:46.529
"Well, you'll definitely need photos to go with your article," Gaby replied.

11
00:00:46.549 --> 00:00:49.311
"So much great artwork will be on display."

12
00:00:49.331 --> 00:00:51.473
"Yep." Ben nodded.

13
00:00:51.493 --> 00:00:54.796
"Do you know that ghost named Pixel?"

14
00:00:55.456 --> 00:00:56.657
Gaby shook her head.

15
00:00:56.677 --> 00:00:59.900
"He's in sixth grade.

16
00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:02.242
He's really good at photography.

17
00:01:02.582 --> 00:01:04.603
He's taking a bunch of photos for my article."

18
00:01:04.623 --> 00:01:09.047
"Cool." Gaby giggled.

19
00:01:09.067 --> 00:01:10.728
"I heard Mr.

20
00:01:10.788 --> 00:01:13.350
Freaky is working on something special for Art Week.

21
00:01:13.951 --> 00:01:15.232
I wonder what it is."

22
00:01:21.617 --> 00:01:25.480
When Ben and Gaby reached their school, they walked up the steps and entered.

23
00:01:32.264 --> 00:01:37.589
It was early, but the halls of Monster Academy were already bustling with activity.

24
00:01:38.769 --> 00:01:43.914
Near the main entrance, students were hanging up art as the art teacher, Ms.

25
00:01:43.954 --> 00:01:46.316
Van Ghoul, called out instructions.

26
00:01:46.336 --> 00:01:50.939
"Zombies, don't drool on the eighth-graders' portraits!

27
00:01:51.880 --> 00:01:56.904
And, mummies, don't trip on your wrapping—you'll drop that beautiful pottery!"

28
00:01:58.105 --> 00:02:01.228
Several witches were hanging up a huge Art Week banner.

29
00:02:03.476 --> 00:02:05.417
Art Week posters covered the walls.

30
00:02:05.937 --> 00:02:10.518
Many of the posters included photos of teachers, which Pixel had taken.

31
00:02:10.538 --> 00:02:18.140
"Hey, Gaby, have you ever heard of the artist Leonardo da Creepy?"

32
00:02:18.560 --> 00:02:19.360
Ben asked.

33
00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:21.121
"Of course!

34
00:02:21.581 --> 00:02:25.502
He's coming to Monster Academy on Friday night for the final event, right?"

35
00:02:29.723 --> 00:02:31.003
Ben lowered his voice.

36
00:02:31.023 --> 00:02:36.523
"It's supposed to be a secret, but he's planning to donate a painting to our school."

37
00:02:36.543 --> 00:02:40.126
"Whoa!" Gaby squealed.

38
00:02:40.146 --> 00:02:44.269
"Da Creepy painted Moaning Lisa.

39
00:02:44.749 --> 00:02:47.472
That's one of the most famous paintings in the world!"

40
00:02:47.492 --> 00:02:49.934
"I know.

41
00:02:50.334 --> 00:02:52.275
That's why this is a really big deal."

42
00:02:52.295 --> 00:02:54.517
"Ben! Gaby!"

43
00:02:55.138 --> 00:02:57.780
They looked up to see Winnie hurrying toward them.

44
00:02:59.541 --> 00:03:02.644
She was carrying her witch's broom and her art supplies.

45
00:03:04.164 --> 00:03:07.505
Mog was trailing after her, wearing a big frown.

46
00:03:11.186 --> 00:03:11.866
wrong, Mog?"

47
00:03:12.166 --> 00:03:13.027
Ben asked.

48
00:03:13.327 --> 00:03:14.347
"You look grumpy."

49
00:03:16.327 --> 00:03:19.088
Mog waved a claw at the artwork in the halls.

50
00:03:19.108 --> 00:03:24.690
"I don't know what all the fuss is about," he grumbled.

51
00:03:25.610 --> 00:03:28.251
Ms. Van Ghoul overheard him and came over.

52
00:03:31.952 --> 00:03:34.345
Mog, the fuss is about art!

53
00:03:35.046 --> 00:03:37.088
And art is for everyone.

54
00:03:38.008 --> 00:03:40.430
Anybody can create something beautiful."

55
00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:43.413
"I can't," Mog said.

56
00:03:43.433 --> 00:03:47.216
"I stink at everything—painting, sculpting, drawing.

57
00:03:47.816 --> 00:03:49.438
I can't even draw a flower.

58
00:03:50.519 --> 00:03:52.680
That's why I don't have anything on display."

59
00:03:52.700 --> 00:03:55.563
"Nonsense, Mog," Ms.

60
00:03:55.583 --> 00:03:56.443
Van Ghoul said.

61
00:03:56.463 --> 00:03:58.085
"And there's still time.

62
00:03:58.485 --> 00:04:00.967
I'll be hanging up art all week long."

63
00:04:07.917 --> 00:04:11.138
you just need to find some inspiration, Mog," Winnie said.

64
00:04:11.158 --> 00:04:14.979
"Yeah, look around at all the cool stuff," Ben said.

65
00:04:14.999 --> 00:04:17.200
"That will give you some ideas."

66
00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:20.421
The Doppel Gang was standing nearby.

67
00:04:20.441 --> 00:04:23.162
The one named Larry snickered.

68
00:04:23.182 --> 00:04:26.883
"We'll help you find some inspiration, Mog."

69
00:04:26.903 --> 00:04:30.924
"Yeah!" Carly said, laughing.

70
00:04:31.712 --> 00:04:32.973
"We know lots about art.

71
00:04:33.614 --> 00:04:35.315
We even know how to improve it!"

72
00:04:35.335 --> 00:04:38.077
"Huh?" Mog said.

73
00:04:38.097 --> 00:04:40.079
"What are you talking about?"

74
00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:44.222
Moe, the third doppelganger, waved him over.

75
00:04:44.242 --> 00:04:45.263
"Come on.

76
00:04:45.463 --> 00:04:47.605
Let's walk around and look at the stuff in the hallways.

77
00:04:47.945 --> 00:04:49.006
We'll show you what we mean."

78
00:04:49.026 --> 00:04:51.748
"Uh Okay."

79
00:04:53.129 --> 00:04:54.991
Mog went off with the doppelgangers.

80
00:04:59.415 --> 00:05:05.595
Winnie headed off to the gym, and Ben wandered through the hallways too, taking notes for his article.

81
00:05:07.156 --> 00:05:09.398
Someone shouted his name.

82
00:05:10.118 --> 00:05:11.699
Ben turned and saw Pixel.

83
00:05:11.719 --> 00:05:13.921
"Ben! Ben!"

84
00:05:14.441 --> 00:05:15.662
the younger ghost cried.

85
00:05:16.262 --> 00:05:19.625
He floated toward Ben, holding up his fancy camera.

86
00:05:20.906 --> 00:05:21.626
"Watch out!"

87
00:05:21.946 --> 00:05:22.607
Ben called.

88
00:05:23.007 --> 00:05:24.188
But it was too late.

89
00:05:25.088 --> 00:05:29.952
Crash! Pixel flew into a piece of pottery, which sailed off its pedestal.

90
00:05:30.944 --> 00:05:34.929
"Oops!" The pot bounced off a blob, who quickly caught it.

91
00:05:34.949 --> 00:05:39.634
"Watch where you're going, ghost!"

92
00:05:39.894 --> 00:05:41.035
the blob snarled.

93
00:05:41.055 --> 00:05:43.598
"It took me a long time to make this thing!"

94
00:05:44.679 --> 00:05:46.321
"Sorry!" Pixel said.

95
00:05:46.341 --> 00:05:48.543
"That's a nice pot, by the way."

96
00:05:49.925 --> 00:05:51.447
He snapped some photos of it.

97
00:06:02.424 --> 00:06:06.446
"You have to get photos of the witches' flying painting," Ben said.

98
00:06:06.466 --> 00:06:08.547
"They're making it in the gym.

99
00:06:08.987 --> 00:06:12.708
When the painting is finished, it will hover in the air."

100
00:06:12.728 --> 00:06:15.169
"That sounds amazing!"

101
00:06:15.490 --> 00:06:16.250
Pixel said.

102
00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:18.991
"I'm planning to take pictures of everything in the show.

103
00:06:19.331 --> 00:06:21.752
I'm hoping to get some cool angles too."

104
00:06:22.553 --> 00:06:25.474
He floated upside down and snapped a photo of Ben.

105
00:06:26.114 --> 00:06:29.515
As he flipped upright, he banged his head on a display table.

106
00:06:29.535 --> 00:06:33.993
"Ouch! Well, the bell's about to ring.

107
00:06:34.573 --> 00:06:35.393
I'll see you later."

108
00:06:35.413 --> 00:06:36.694
"Bye, Pixel."

109
00:06:37.834 --> 00:06:41.156
As Ben started toward his locker, loud laughter rang out.

110
00:06:42.736 --> 00:06:47.578
At the other end of the hallway, he saw a big group of monsters looking at something on

111
00:06:47.618 --> 00:06:48.059
the wall.

112
00:06:48.079 --> 00:06:50.700
"It must be a cool piece of art."

113
00:06:52.100 --> 00:06:54.421
Ben hurried over and gasped.

114
00:06:55.362 --> 00:06:57.703
The monsters were looking at an Art Week poster.

115
00:06:58.263 --> 00:07:00.344
The poster featured a photo of Mr.

116
00:07:00.404 --> 00:07:06.094
Freaky. But someone had drawn a big black mustache under the principal's three noses!
